        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009657"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Edeine D is a subtype of edeine similar to edeine A with the beta-tyr replaced by beta-phe-beta-ala. Edeines bind to the 30S subunit to block fMet-tRNA interaction at the P site, inhibiting protein synthesis and subsequent structure/function processes critical for life or replication.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PubChem:170400</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
