        <owl:annotatedTarget>Tylosin is a 16-membered macrolide, naturally produced by Streptomyces fradiae. It interacts with the bacterial ribosome 50S subunit to inhibit protein synthesis.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:19793461</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
