        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0000000"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Spiramycin is a 16-membered macrolide and is natural product produced by Streptomyces ambofaciens. It binds to the 50S subunit of bacterial ribosomes and inhibits peptidyl transfer activity to disrupt protein synthesis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
