        <owl:annotatedTarget>Rifamycin antibiotics are a group of broad-spectrum ansamycin antibiotics that inhibit bacterial RNA polymerase by binding to a highly conserved region, blocking the oligonucleotide exit tunnel, and preventing the extension of nascent mRNAs.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:15700959</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
