        <owl:annotatedTarget>Diaminopyrimidines are a class of organic compounds containing a pyrimidine ring substituted by two amine groups.  They are inhibitors of dihydrofolate reductase, an enzyme critical for DNA synthesis.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:8195830</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
