            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A category of aminoglycoside O-nucleotidyltransferase enzymes with modification regiospecificity based at the 4&apos;-hydroxyl group of the respective antibiotic. These enzymes inactivate aminoglycoside antibiotics by transfer of an AMP group from an ATP substrate to the 4-hydroxyl group of the compound.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>aadD</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>ant(4&apos;,4&apos;&apos;)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
