        <obo:IAO_0000115>The mphB gene encodes for MPH(2&apos;)-II. This enzymes phosphorylates 14-membered and 16-membered macrolides.  It phosphorylates macrolides in GTP- dependent manner at 2&apos;-OH hydroxyl of desosamine sugar of macrolides.</obo:IAO_0000115>
