            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Single nucleotide polymorphisms (SNPs) in rRNA can confer antibiotic resistance to drugs that target the bacterial ribosome.</obo:IAO_0000115>
