        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0001004"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Genes that confer antibiotic resistance by hydrolyzing bonds to linearize and deactivate antibiotics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
