        <owl:annotatedTarget>A category of aminoglycoside N-acetyltransferase enzymes with modification regiospecificity based at the 6&apos;-amino group of the respective antibiotic. These enzymes inactivate aminoglycoside antibiotics through acetylation of the 6-amino group of the compound.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:15673721</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


