            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>AcrEF-TolC is a tripartite multidrug efflux system similar to AcrAB-TolC and found in Gram-negative bacteria. AcrE is the membrane fusion protein, AcrF is the inner membrane transporter, and TolC is the outer membrane channel protein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
