        <owl:annotatedTarget>FEZ-1 is an Ambler class B MBL; subclass B3 first isolated from Legionella gormanii.  It has activity against a broad range of beta-lactams and is only active with two Zn(II) ions in the active site.</owl:annotatedTarget>
