        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009109"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Ceftaroline is a novel cephalosporin active against methicillin resistant Staphylococcus aureus. Like other cephalosporins it binds penicillin-binding proteins to inhibit cell wall synthesis. It strongly binds with PBP2a, associated with methicillin resistance. It is taken orally as the prodrug ceftaroline fosamil.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CAS:189345-04-8</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CHEBI:70729</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
