            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>SdiA is a cell division regulator that is also a positive regulator of AcrAB only when it&apos;s expressed from a plasmid. When the sdiA gene is on the chromosome, it has no effect on expression of acrAB.</obo:IAO_0000115>
