            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>BaeS is a sensor kinase in the BaeSR regulatory system. While it phosphorylates BaeR to increase its activity, BaeS is not necessary for overexpressed BaeR to confer resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>baeS</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
