            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>CpxA is a membrane-localized sensor kinase that is activated by envelope stress. It starts a kinase cascade that activates CpxR, which promotes efflux complex expression.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>cpxA</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
