            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>EvgA, when phosphorylated, is a positive regulator for efflux protein complexes emrKY and mdtEF. While usually phosphorylated in a EvgS dependent manner, it can be phosphorylated in the absence of EvgS when overexpressed.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>evgA</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
