        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A novel bleomycin resistance protein encoded by a metallo-beta-lactamase-associated ble gene. Expression of BRP(MBL) confers resistance to bleomycin and bleomycin-like antibiotics in Enterobacteriaceae and Acinetobacter, where it is co-expressed with an MBL and controlled by the same promoter region.</obo:IAO_0000115>
