        <obo:IAO_0000115>Kirrothricin is produced by Streptomyces cinnamoneus and is structurally related to kirromycin, aurodox, heneicomycin and shares a similar spectrum of antibacterial activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CHEBI:223261</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
