        <owl:annotatedTarget>Kirrothricin is produced by Streptomyces cinnamoneus and is structurally related to kirromycin, aurodox, heneicomycin and shares a similar spectrum of antibacterial activity.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:7142013</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
