            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The MdtG protein, also named YceE, appears to be a member of the major facilitator superfamily of transporters, and it has been reported, when overexpressed, to increase fosfomycin and deoxycholate resistances. mdtG is a member of the marA-soxS-rob regulon.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>mdtG</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>yceE</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3001329</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>mdtG</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3001329"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
