            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Homologous to vanC, contains a D-Ala-D-Ser ligase. The plasmid-located vanM gene cluster is inducible and confers low resistance to vancomycin. vanN organisms remain susceptible to teicoplanin. Gene orientation: N(XY)TRS.</obo:IAO_0000115>
