            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>RNA polymerase is a multisubunit enzyme that is necessary for transcription. The beta prime subunit of RNA polymerase forms the active center of the enzyme and template/transcript binding sites. Mutations in rpoC gene confers antibiotic resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
