        <owl:annotatedTarget>tlyA encodes for hemolysin. It Catalyzes the 2&apos;-O-methylation at nucleotides C1409 in 16S rRNA and C1920 in 23S rRNA. Mutation that arise within this gene reduces the binding affinity of aminoglycosides to rRNA.</owl:annotatedTarget>
