            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>VanI is a D-Ala-D-Lac ligase that reduces vancomycin binding affinity, helping to confer vancomycin resistance as part of the VanI resistance gene cluster in Desulfitobacterium spp. and Desulfosporosinus spp.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>vanI</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
