            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A specific fusidic acid resistance gene conferring intrinsic resistance in the bacteria Staphylococcus saprophyticus. FusD behaves by causing dissociation of EF-G from the ribosome thus counteracting the action of Fusidic acid. It is considered a FusB-type protein.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>fusD</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
