        <owl:annotatedTarget>nfsB encodes the minor oxygen-insesitive nitroreductase in E. coli. The first step of resistance to nitrofurazone is mutation of nfsA, while the increased resistance associated with second step mutants is a consequence of nfsB mutation.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:18544599</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:26552976</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
