            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>mgrB is a small transmembrane protein produced in the PhoPQ signalling system. It acts as a negative regulator in this system. Inactivation or down-regulation of mgrB confers colistin resistance by absence as shown in Klebsiella pneumoniae.</obo:IAO_0000115>
