            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Mutations to the active importer GlpT, which is involved with the uptake of many phosphorylated sugars, confer resistance to fosfomycin by reducing import of the drug into the bacteria.</obo:IAO_0000115>
