    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3003951 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3003951">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009658"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Microcin J25 is a peptide antibiotic that inhibits transcription by bacterial RNA polymerase. MccJ25 is produced by Escherichia coli strains that harbor a plasmid-borne antibiotic-synthesis and antibiotic-export cassette, consisting of a gene for MccJ25 precursor (a 58 residue linear peptide), two genes for factors that process MccJ25 precursor into MccJ25, and one gene for export of MccJ25.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CHEBI:203056</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ChEMBL:CHEMBL1945674</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PubChem:139584748</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>MccJ25</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3003951</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>microcin J25</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3003951"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Microcin J25 is a peptide antibiotic that inhibits transcription by bacterial RNA polymerase. MccJ25 is produced by Escherichia coli strains that harbor a plasmid-borne antibiotic-synthesis and antibiotic-export cassette, consisting of a gene for MccJ25 precursor (a 58 residue linear peptide), two genes for factors that process MccJ25 precursor into MccJ25, and one gene for export of MccJ25.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:15200952</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3003952 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3003952">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0010001"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3003951"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>YojI mediates resistance to the peptide antibiotic microcin J25 when it is expressed from a multicopy vector. YojI is capable of pumping out microcin molecules.  The outer membrane protein TolC in addition to YojI is required for export of microcin J25 out of the cell. Microcin J25 is thus the first known substrate for YojI.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>YojI</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3003952</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>YojI</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3003952"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>YojI mediates resistance to the peptide antibiotic microcin J25 when it is expressed from a multicopy vector. YojI is capable of pumping out microcin molecules.  The outer membrane protein TolC in addition to YojI is required for export of microcin J25 out of the cell. Microcin J25 is thus the first known substrate for YojI.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:15866933</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
