        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009107"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Ceftiofur is a third-generation broad spectrum cephalosporin and beta-lactam antibiotic predominantly used in veterinary medicine. It causes cell lysis by disrupting peptidoglycan cross-linkage and cell wall formation by binding to PBPs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
