        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009125"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Nafcillin is a penicillin-class narrow-spectrum beta-lactam antibiotic. It inhibits cell wall synthesis and peptidoglycan cross-linkage through binding to PBPs, similarly to other penicillin-like antibiotics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
