        <owl:annotatedTarget>kdpDE is a two-component regulatory system in Escherichia coli, well studied for its role in potassium transport and homeostasis. kdpE is also implicated in virulence loci regulation and overexpression of kdpE is shown to confer resistance to aminoglycoside antibiotics.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:23555240</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
