            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>kdpD is a component of the two-component regulatory system, kdpDE. This system is involved in potassium transport and homeostasis, and has been implicated in virulence factor regulation along with kdpE.</obo:IAO_0000115>
