        <obo:IAO_0000115>Point mutations in Escherichia coli which have been shown to increase the minimum inhibitory concentration of the antibiotic triclosan. It is hypothesized that decreased susceptibility to triclosan in E. coli gyrA mutants occurs indirectly due to alterations in the stress response pathways.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Ecol_gyrA_TRC</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
