            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Lipid A acyltransferase genes confer resistance to certain types of peptide antibiotics such as polymyxins through the aminoacylation of lipopolysaccharide, thereby decreasing the negative charge of the outer membrane surface.</obo:IAO_0000115>
