        <obo:IAO_0000115>A member of the AlmEFG operon, responsible for polymyxin resistance in Vibrio cholerae. AlmG is a glycyltransferase closely related to lipid A acyltransferases. Described by Henderson JC et al. 2017.</obo:IAO_0000115>
