        <obo:IAO_0000115>Concentration at which bacterial cells in suspension, calculated with respect to final volume (colony forming units/milliliter (cfu/mL)). The standard for broth dilution is 5 x 105cfu/mL. The standard for agar dilution is 104cfu/mL.</obo:IAO_0000115>
