        <obo:IAO_0000115>The control of the antibiotic susceptibility testing, whether there was an experimental control (same strain, with and without resistance determinant) or if there was a group of clinical isolates found to have a resistance determinant compared against a strain without that resistance determinant.</obo:IAO_0000115>
