        <obo:IAO_0000115>Antibiotic susceptibility testing is performed on a group of clinical isolates with a resistance determinant compared to different strains that do not have this resistance determinant. No experiment was performed to delete / insert the resistance determinant to determine antibiotic susceptibility using the same genetic background.</obo:IAO_0000115>
