    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004588">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3000748"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000001"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0000032"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000050"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004598"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>KpnG consists of ~390 residues and resembles EmrA of E. coli. Disruption of the pump components KpnG-KpnH signficantly decrease resistance to azithromycin, ceftazidime, ciprofloxacin, ertapenem, erythromycin, gentamicin, imipenem, ticarcillin, norfloxacin, polymyxin-B, piperacillin, spectinomycin, tobramycin, and streptomycin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>C8T8U1</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Kpne_KpnG</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3004588</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Klebsiella pneumoniae KpnG</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3004588"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>KpnG consists of ~390 residues and resembles EmrA of E. coli. Disruption of the pump components KpnG-KpnH signficantly decrease resistance to azithromycin, ceftazidime, ciprofloxacin, ertapenem, erythromycin, gentamicin, imipenem, ticarcillin, norfloxacin, polymyxin-B, piperacillin, spectinomycin, tobramycin, and streptomycin.</owl:annotatedTarget>
