        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0000001"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A fluoroquinolone with potent activity against Gram-positive pathogens. Showed the most potent in vitro and in vivo activities against drug-resistant Streptococcus pneumoniae. One of the most potent antibacterial agent against penicillin-resistant S. pneumoniae in a murine systemic infection model.</obo:IAO_0000115>
