        <owl:annotatedTarget>A fluoroquinolone with potent activity against Gram-positive pathogens. Showed the most potent in vitro and in vivo activities against drug-resistant Streptococcus pneumoniae. One of the most potent antibacterial agent against penicillin-resistant S. pneumoniae in a murine systemic infection model.</owl:annotatedTarget>
