        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0000001"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An 8-cyano-substituted fluoroquinolone with increased antibacterial activity in acidic conditions in contrast to other fluoroquinolones which demonstrate reduced activity in lower pH. Finafloxacin showed increased bactericidal activity at pH 5 in comparison to pH 7 and ciprofloxacin at pH 5 in vitro.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CAS:209342-40-5</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
