        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_1000003"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Polyketides are a large group of secondary metabolites. Some polyketide compounds have been shown to possess antibiotic activity and qualities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
