            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>NDM-33 confers resistance to all beta-lactam antibiotics except aztreonam. It was first identified in an E. coli strain isolated from hospital sewage. It differs from NDM-5 by a single amino acid substitution (A72T).</obo:IAO_0000115>
