            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Enmetazobactam is a beta-lactamase inhibitor which exhibits activity against class A extended spectrum beta-lactamases. It is currently in clinical trials in combination with cefepine for the treatment of urinary tract infections and acute pyelonephritis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
