        <obo:IAO_0000115>Nitazoxanide is a thiazolide antiparatasitic and antiviral drug that has demonstrated antibacterial activity against Helicobacter pylori. It is well tolerated and exhibits a synergistic effect with other antibiotics, such as clarithromycin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
