        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>vanP is a D-Ala-D-Ala ligase homolog that synthesizes D-Ala-D-Lac, an alternative substrate for peptidoglycan synthesis that reduces vancomycin binding affinity. It is associated with both vancomycin and teicoplanin resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
