        <obo:IAO_0000115>Phenylalanine-arginine beta-naphthylamide is a widely-used experimental efflux pump inhibitor. It has also been shown to increase Gram-negative membrane permeability and enhance the entry of antibiotics, even in efflux pump deficient strains. It is also able to inhibit the formation of bacterial biofilms and disrupt quorum sensing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>ChEMBL:CHEMBL56252</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PubChem:443301</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
