        <obo:IAO_0000115>Pivmecillinam, the oral prodrug of the antimicrobial active agent mecillinam, is a bona fide agent for uncomplicated lower urinary tract infections (UTIs), because of its selectivity and effect against several species of Enterobacteriaceae.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CAS:32886-97-8</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
