        <obo:IAO_0000115>TAC1 is a Zn2Cys6 transcription factor that transcriptionally activates efflux units CDR1 and CDR2. Mutations in TAC1 upregulate CDR1 and CDR2 causing increased resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
