        <obo:IAO_0000115>CplR is an ABC-F ATPase ribosomal protection protein from Clostridioides difficile which confers resistance to pleuromutilins and lincosamides. Its resistance to these antibiotics increases in synergy with erythromcyin resistance methylases (e.g., ermB).</obo:IAO_0000115>
