        <obo:IAO_0000115>MdtQ is a putative multidrug resistance outer membrane protein found in carbapenem-resistant Klebsiella pneumoniae.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>MdtQ</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
