        <obo:IAO_0000115>Point mutations in Salmonella gyrA that confer resistance to ciprofloxacin and nalidixic acid which are fluoroquinolone antibiotics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Sisa_gyrA_FLO</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
