        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0000000"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Gamithromycin, a novel semi-synthetic macrolide, is approved for the treatment and prevention of bovine respiratory disease. It plays a bacteriostatic and bactericidal role by inhibiting the ribosomal 50S subunit.</obo:IAO_0000115>
