        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009105"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Cefatrizine is a broad-spectrum, semisynthetic, first-generation cephalosporin with antibacterial activity. Cefatrizine binds to and inactivates penicillin-binding proteins located on the inner membrane of the bacterial cell wall causing cell lysis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
