        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009106"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Ceforanide is a second-generation cephalosporin antibiotic. It is effective against many coliforms, including Escherichia coli, Klebsiella, Enterobacter and Proteus, and most strains of Salmonella, Shigella, Hemophilus, Citrobacter species.</obo:IAO_0000115>
