            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The ase1 gene encodes a microtubule associated protein that is particularly involved in the mitotic spindle formation and stabilization during cell division. Alterations in cell division can often lead to major genetic adaptations, such as the development of aneuploidy. In instances where a fungi can survive a major genetic adaptation, the resultant mutant could exhibit antifungal resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009274</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Aspergillus fumigatus ase1 with mutations conferring resistance to voriconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009275 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009275">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009301"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009185"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0001000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009344"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Mitochondrial electron transport chain (ETC) proteins involved in the respiratory chain complex for aerobic respiration in fungal organisms. Mutations in these proteins are associated with antifungal resistance by disrupting the inhibitory effect of certain fungicides like strobilurins.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009275</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Colletotrichum gloeosporioides cytochrome b protein with mutations conferring resistance to azoxystrobin</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


