    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009281 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009281">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009301"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009307"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0001000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009344"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Mitochondrial electron transport chain (ETC) proteins involved in the respiratory chain complex for aerobic respiration in fungal organisms. Mutations in these proteins are associated with antifungal resistance by disrupting the inhibitory effect of certain fungicides like strobilurins. Kresoxim-methyl is an example of a strolurin fungicide.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009281</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Colletotrichum gloeosporioides cytochrome b protein with mutations associated with resistance to kresoxim-methyl</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009282 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009282">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009200"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007511"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0001000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009401"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The fungal Cyp51 enzyme system belongs to the broader P450 family. It is integral to ergosterol synthesis. Azoles target lanosterol demethylase thereby halting ergosterol production and ultimately compromises fungal cell membrane integrity. Mutations to Cyp51 genes have been shown to inhibit azole activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009282</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Aspergillus flavus Cyp51c with mutations conferring resistance to itraconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009283 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009283">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009200"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007512"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0001000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009401"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The fungal Cyp51 enzyme system belongs to the broader P450 family. It is integral to ergosterol synthesis. Azoles target lanosterol demethylase thereby halting ergosterol production and ultimately compromises fungal cell membrane integrity. Mutations to Cyp51 genes have been shown to inhibit azole activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009283</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Aspergillus flavus Cyp51c with mutations conferring resistance to voriconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009284 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009284">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0000031"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Dihydrofolate Reductase (DHFR) is an enzyme integral to nucleotide and protein synthesis for eukaryotic life inclusive of fungi. This enzyme is targeted by certain drugs to to halt nucleotide synthesis and killing the target eukaryotic cell. Some of these drugs are useful against fungal infections, but mutations to this gene can lead to resistance against such intervention.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009284</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>antifungal-resistant dhfr</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009285 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009285">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009284"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3000327"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009163"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Dihydrofolate Reductase (DHFR) is an enzyme integral to nucleotide and protein synthesis for eukaryotic life inclusive of fungi. This enzyme is targeted by certain drugs to to halt nucleotide synthesis and killing the target eukaryotic cell. Some of these drugs are useful against fungal infections, but mutations to this gene can lead to resistance against such intervention.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009285</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Pneumocystis jerovecii dhfr with mutations associated with resistance to pyrimethamine-sulfadoxine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009286 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009286">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007556"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009160"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0001000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009197"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Fur1 encodes a uracil phosphoribosyltransferase which is essential in nucleotide synthesis in eukaryotes inclusive of fungi. Mutations to the enzyme have been show to confer resistance to 5-fluorocystosine.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009286</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Nakaseomyces glabratus Fur1 with mutations associated with resistance to 5-fluorocytosine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009287 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009287">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007546"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007503"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0001000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009314"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Glucan synthase FKS1 is involved in the production of the fungal cell wall by the synthesis of the core component beta-1,3-glucan in some fungi. Mutations in FKS1 have been shown to confer resistance to echinocandin antibiotics such as anidulafungin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009287</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Pichia kudriavzevii Fks1 beta-1,3-glucan synthase with mutations associated with resistance to anidulafungin</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009287"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>Glucan synthase FKS1 is involved in the production of the fungal cell wall by the synthesis of the core component beta-1,3-glucan in some fungi. Mutations in FKS1 have been shown to confer resistance to echinocandin antibiotics such as anidulafungin.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:40790106</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009288 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009288">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009200"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009308"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The Cyp51 enzyme belongs to the P450 protein system and is integral to ergosterol synthesis. Azoles target lanosterol demethylase thereby halting ergosterol production and ultimately compromises fungal cell membrane integrity. Mutations to the P450/Cyp51 genes have been shown to inhibit azole activity inclusive of flutriafol, which is a triazole despite not adhering to  traditional azole naming convention.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009288</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Colletotrichum truncatum Cyp51 with mutations associated with resistance to flutriafol</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009289 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009289">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009284"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007314"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Dihydrofolate Reductase (DHFR) is an enzyme integral to nucleotide and protein synthesis for eukaryotic life inclusive of fungi. This enzyme is targeted by certain drugs to to halt nucleotide synthesis and killing the target eukaryotic cell. Some of these drugs are useful against fungal infections, but mutations to this gene can lead to resistance against such intervention.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009289</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Pneumocystis jerovecii dhfr with mutations associated with resistance to pentamidine</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009290 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009290">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009284"/>
