            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Cdc enzymes involved in DNA replication initiation by forming and maintaining the pre-replicative complex and serving as a loading factor for the Mcm proteins onto chromatin. Its combination with a simultaneous unrelated putative FKS2 mutation results in echinocandin resistance that is more prominent than echinocandin resistance conferred by the FKS2 mutation alone.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009392</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>antifungal resistant cdc</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009393 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009393">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009621"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007511"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0001000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009313"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The fungal Erg11 enzyme is lanosterol demethylase belongs to the broader P450 family. The enzyme contributes directly to ergosterol synthesis pathway. Azoles target lanosterol demethylase thereby halting ergosterol production and ultimately compromises fungal cell membrane integrity. Mutations to Erg11 genes have been shown to inhibit azole activity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Candidozyma auris</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009393</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Candida auris ERG11 lanosterol 14-alpha-demethylase with mutations conferring resistance to itraconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009393"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>The fungal Erg11 enzyme is lanosterol demethylase belongs to the broader P450 family. The enzyme contributes directly to ergosterol synthesis pathway. Azoles target lanosterol demethylase thereby halting ergosterol production and ultimately compromises fungal cell membrane integrity. Mutations to Erg11 genes have been shown to inhibit azole activity.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:29593275</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:34633842</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


