                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009322"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Mutations in the beta tubulin gene of phytopathogenic fungi have shown to cause resistance against the benzimidazole class of antifungal pesticides, which target beta-tubulin. Thiabendazole is a unique member of the benzimidazole class that can be used for human treatment. Benzimidazoles like thiabendazole are structurally defined as imidazole rings fused to benzene rings.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009433</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Colletotrichum gloeosporioides beta tubulin with mutations conferring resistance to thiabendazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009434 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009434">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009342"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007511"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>In fungi, AFR directly encodes an ABC pump that allows for a baseline efflux of antifungal drugs, especially azoles. Mutations can result in excessive efflux of these drugs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009434</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Cryptococcus neoformans AFR1 with mutations conferring resistance against itraconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009435 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009435">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009342"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007517"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>In fungi, AFR directly encodes an ABC pump that allows for a baseline efflux of antifungal drugs, especially azoles. Mutations can result in excessive efflux of these drugs.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009435</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Cryptococcus neoformans AFR1 with mutations conferring resistance against ketoconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009436 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009436">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009440"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007508"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>CDR genes encode ABC efflux pumps that, when over expressed, confer resistance to azole antifungal compounds. This event prevents the effective inhibition of ergosterol synthesis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009436</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Candida albicans CDR1 with mutations conferring resistance to fluconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009437 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009437">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009440"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009353"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>CDR genes encode ABC efflux pumps that, when over expressed, confer resistance to antifungal compounds. Tacrolimus is a calcineurin inhibitor that interferes with stress-response and survival pathways. If tacrolimus is excessively pumped out of the cell, the drugs efficacy is lowered.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009437</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Candida albicans CDR1 with mutations conferring resistance to tacrolimus</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009437"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget>CDR genes encode ABC efflux pumps that, when over expressed, confer resistance to antifungal compounds. Tacrolimus is a calcineurin inhibitor that interferes with stress-response and survival pathways. If tacrolimus is excessively pumped out of the cell, the drugs efficacy is lowered.</owl:annotatedTarget>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>PMID:40790106</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009438 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009438">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009440"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007508"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>CDR genes encode ABC efflux pumps that, when over expressed, confer resistance to azole antifungal compounds. This event prevents the effective inhibition of ergosterol synthesis.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Nakaseomyces glabratus</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009438</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Candida glabrata CDR1 with mutations conferring resistance to fluconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009439 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009439">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009440"/>
