    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009462 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009462">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009440"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007508"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The PDR family of genes relate to efflux pumps. PDR5 directly encodes an efflux pump which is a homologue of CDR efflux pumps. PDR1 and PDR3 are transcription factors that upregulate the synthesis of PDR5. When mutated, a fungal species can exhibit resistance against antifungal compounds.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009462</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Cryptococcus neoformans PDR5 with mutations conferring resistance to fluconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009463 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009463">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0010001"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The atr subset of efflux pumps fall under the ABC efflux pump family. When mutated, they can confer resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009463</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>fungal atr</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009464 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009464">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009463"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009189"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>MgAtr is an Atr gene, encoding an efflux pump that reduces azole efficacy when mutated.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009464</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Zymoseptoria tritici MgAtr with mutations conferring resistance to cyproconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009465 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009465">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_0010001"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Yor is a family of ABC transporters that, when mutated, can confer antifungal resistance.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009465</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>fungal Yor</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009466 -->

    <owl:Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009466">
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3009465"/>
        <rdfs:subClassOf>
            <owl:Restriction>
                <owl:onProperty rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_2000000"/>
                <owl:someValuesFrom rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/ARO_3007513"/>
            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Yor1 can cause excessive efflux of azoles when mutated.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>Nakaseomyces glabratus</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:id>ARO:3009466</oboInOwl:id>
        <rdfs:label>Candida glabrata Yor1 with mutations conferring resistance to posaconazole</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


