        <obo:IAO_0000115>Glucan synthase FKS1 is involved in the production of the fungal cell wall by the synthesis of the core component beta-1,3-glucan in some fungi. Mutations in FKS2 have been shown to confer resistance to echinocandin antibiotics.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
