        <obo:IAO_0000115>AAC(6&apos;)-Va is an aminoglycoside modifying enzyme identified from Aeromonas hydrophila, and associated with decreased susceptibility to aminoglycoside antibiotics including ribostamycin.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>AAC(6&apos;)-Va</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>antibiotic_resistance</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
